    "description": "<p>After an enemy you can see resolves an <strong>Attack</strong>, <strong>Objective</strong>, <strong>Skill</strong>, or <strong>Spell</strong> action, you may discard up to <strong>【SL + 1】</strong> cards that are <strong>jokers</strong> or whose <strong>suit</strong> corresponds to a damage type based on the enemy action: <strong>ice (Attack)</strong>, <strong>fire (Objective)</strong>, <strong>earth (Skill)</strong>, or <strong>air (Spell)</strong>. If you do, draw that many cards; then you may perform the <strong>Spell</strong> action for free, casting a spell with a total Mind Point cost equal to or lower than <strong>【SL × 5】</strong> (you must still pay its MP cost) and you cannot use this Skill again until the start of your next turn.</p>",
